sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant LLM
    participant Host as EVE host
    participant G as geocode
    participant E as effis
    participant S as serpapi

    User->>Host: Wildfire briefing for Evia, August 2021
    Host->>LLM: Question and tool list

    Note over LLM: Reason. EFFIS needs a bbox. Geocode first.
    LLM->>Host: geocode_place(place_name="Evia island")
    Host->>G: tools/call
    G-->>Host: bbox 22.8285,37.9489,24.5933,39.0396
    Host->>LLM: Observation

    Note over LLM: Reason. Pass that bbox to EFFIS.
    LLM->>Host: get_effis_burnt_areas(bbox, date="2021-08")
    Host->>E: tools/call
    E-->>Host: Fires with area_ha, commune, firedate
    Host->>LLM: Observation

    Note over LLM: Reason. The news part needs a search.
    LLM->>Host: search_google(query="Evia wildfire August 2021")
    Host->>S: tools/call
    S-->>Host: Titles, URLs, snippets
    Host->>LLM: Observation

    LLM-->>User: Briefing. Each fact names its tool.
